# --- Docker build context exclusions -----------------------------------------
#
# Everything listed here is kept out of the build context sent to the daemon.
# It is not a substitute for careful COPY instructions: docker/Dockerfile
# copies only the files each stage needs. What this file protects against is
# a slow context and, above all, secrets or local configuration reaching a
# layer by accident.
#
# Note: this format has no inline comments — a comment occupies a whole line.


# --- Local configuration and secrets -----------------------------------------
.config/
.secrets/
**/.env
**/.envrc


# --- Environments, caches and build output -----------------------------------
**/.venv
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[codz]
**/.*cache
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov/
**/coverage.xml
**/junit.xml
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/
**/node_modules/
**/*.log
var/


# --- Tooling, docs and CI ----------------------------------------------------
# Tracked in git, but never needed inside an image.
.git/
.github/
.dockerignore
.editorconfig
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.cz.toml
.changelog.md.j2
.ruff.toml
.mypy.ini
.importlinter
.python-version
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
justfile
docker/
docs/
scripts/
frontend/


# --- Agent instructions ------------------------------------------------------
**/CLAUDE.md
**/.claude/
